WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.330
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:02.600 --> 00:06.000
National Radio and Television Administration

3
01:25.000 --> 01:30.000
Welcome to Sister Pang's Bathhouse.

4
01:41.880 --> 01:43.400
Here, Aunt Fang, have some water.

5
01:43.400 --> 01:43.960
Thank you.

6
01:43.960 --> 01:44.890
You're welcome.

7
01:45.160 --> 01:46.000
Lawyer Xiao.

8
01:46.680 --> 01:48.120
Sorry for the trouble.

9
01:48.520 --> 01:49.680
Don't say that.

10
01:50.160 --> 01:50.840
So, Aunt Fang.

11
01:50.840 --> 01:53.840
May I ask who owes you the money?

12
01:54.640 --> 01:55.970
Her name is Wang Lijuan.

13
01:56.640 --> 01:59.960
She's a good friend I grew up with.

14
02:00.120 --> 02:02.400
We are like real sisters.

15
02:02.600 --> 02:03.860
I don't have children.

16
02:04.000 --> 02:05.600
Lijuan's son, Zhang Guang,

17
02:05.760 --> 02:08.820
has recognized me as his godmother since he was little.

18
02:09.639 --> 02:11.170
Such a close relationship.

19
02:11.240 --> 02:12.970
No wonder you trust her so much.

20
02:13.280 --> 02:14.560
It was out of trust.

21
02:16.600 --> 02:18.960
The first time Lijuan and her son came,

22
02:19.240 --> 02:22.520
they borrowed 500,000 for business turnover,

23
02:23.120 --> 02:24.520
and paid it back quickly.

24
02:24.640 --> 02:27.760
So when she came to borrow a million later,

25
02:27.760 --> 02:29.400
I lent it without thinking much.

26
02:29.400 --> 02:31.460
So she hasn't paid back this million?

27
02:33.040 --> 02:34.840
Not only did they not pay it back,

28
02:35.120 --> 02:36.840
but after a while,

29
02:37.680 --> 02:41.079
the mother and son came to borrow another two million from me.

30
02:42.920 --> 02:43.680
Huilan,

31
02:45.120 --> 02:47.400
if it wasn't absolutely necessary,

32
02:48.000 --> 02:50.200
I would never have asked you for this.

33
02:50.760 --> 02:53.680
I brought the IOU and the ink pad

34
02:53.840 --> 02:55.400
just to give you a promise.

35
02:56.560 --> 02:57.280
Godmother,

36
02:57.560 --> 02:59.040
if we can't get this money together,

37
02:59.040 --> 03:00.760
the money we invested before

38
03:00.840 --> 03:03.680
and the one million you lent us will all go down the drain.

39
03:03.680 --> 03:06.120
Our two houses have already been mortgaged.

40
03:06.120 --> 03:07.120
My mom also got seriously ill

41
03:07.120 --> 03:08.760
and was just discharged from the hospital a couple of days ago.

42
03:08.760 --> 03:10.840
Well, I carry my medicine every day.

43
03:15.000 --> 03:15.560
Lijuan,

44
03:17.120 --> 03:19.180
it's not that I don't want to help you,

45
03:19.840 --> 03:24.000
but I've lent you all my savings,

46
03:24.560 --> 03:26.560
as well as my mom's pension.

47
03:28.400 --> 03:30.400
Huilan, you...

48
03:31.120 --> 03:32.000
Look at me,

49
03:32.000 --> 03:34.000
what have I done?

50
03:34.280 --> 03:36.120
If we can't turn things around this time,

51
03:36.120 --> 03:39.720
we won't be able to pay back the money we borrowed from you before.

52
03:40.000 --> 03:41.280
If that happens,

53
03:41.280 --> 03:43.000
how could I ever face you?

54
03:43.000 --> 03:44.840
How can I face Auntie?

55
03:45.800 --> 03:46.520
I...

56
03:47.840 --> 03:48.960
Forget it, Mom.

57
03:49.079 --> 03:51.000
Let's not make things difficult for Godmother.

58
03:51.000 --> 03:52.600
The practical difficulties are obvious.

59
03:52.600 --> 03:54.680
We can't ask Godmother to mortgage her house

60
03:54.680 --> 03:55.440
to help us.

61
03:55.960 --> 03:56.840
Let's go back.

62
03:59.400 --> 04:00.280
Hold her.

63
04:00.280 --> 04:01.400
Mom, slow down.

64
04:03.240 --> 04:03.800
Come.

65
04:07.720 --> 04:08.400
Lijuan.

66
04:15.080 --> 04:15.840
ID number: 210340199309167831.

67
04:15.840 --> 04:17.700
ID number: 210340199309167831.

68
04:18.279 --> 04:21.279
You mean you mortgaged your house

69
04:21.279 --> 04:22.560
and lent her the money?

70
04:23.840 --> 04:26.840
Ma'am, when you took out such a big loan,

71
04:26.840 --> 04:28.240
didn't you find someone who knows about this

72
04:28.240 --> 04:29.560
or ask a lawyer?

73
04:30.000 --> 04:31.660
Didn't you think it was risky?

74
04:34.840 --> 04:37.440
Then why didn't Wang Lijuan pay back the money?

75
04:37.880 --> 04:39.540
She said the business failed,

76
04:40.280 --> 04:41.280
and the invested money

77
04:41.280 --> 04:43.280
couldn't be recovered at all.

78
04:43.680 --> 04:46.280
She asked me to give her more time.

79
04:47.680 --> 04:48.600
But

80
04:49.080 --> 04:52.680
the bank called me yesterday and said they would sue me.

81
04:53.520 --> 04:55.880
They also said that if the two million mortgage

82
04:55.880 --> 04:58.159
isn't paid off,

83
04:58.560 --> 05:01.120
they will take my house away.

84
05:01.680 --> 05:04.680
That's the only house my mom and I have.

85
05:04.680 --> 05:06.280
I understand. Yes, don't worry.

86
05:06.280 --> 05:09.240
My mom is not in good health now.

87
05:10.000 --> 05:11.720
She definitely can't handle any more stress.

88
05:11.720 --> 05:12.720
I understand. Let's figure out a way first.

89
05:12.720 --> 05:13.720
It's okay, ma'am.

90
05:14.560 --> 05:15.880
I've read this IOU.

91
05:15.880 --> 05:17.000
There's no problem,

92
05:17.000 --> 05:18.160
and the interest is reasonable.

93
05:18.160 --> 05:19.080
Right, look.

94
05:19.400 --> 05:21.400
The IOU is fine, so we have a case.

95
05:21.400 --> 05:21.880
Since we have a case,

96
05:21.880 --> 05:23.440
just leave this case to us.

97
05:23.440 --> 05:24.700
We can definitely win.

98
05:25.120 --> 05:25.440
Otherwise,

99
05:25.440 --> 05:27.880
let's sign the agency contract first.

100
05:27.880 --> 05:32.159
Well, all my money has been borrowed by them.

101
05:33.080 --> 05:34.409
As for the lawyer's fee,

102
05:34.560 --> 05:38.000
can I pay it after I get the money back?

103
05:38.880 --> 05:41.840
Even if I pay a little more, it's fine.

104
05:42.840 --> 05:44.280
How about this, ma'am?

105
05:45.000 --> 05:46.840
We can do a contingency fee.

106
05:48.280 --> 05:50.280
What does contingency fee mean?

107
05:50.280 --> 05:52.159
It means we fight the lawsuit first and collect the fee later.

108
05:52.159 --> 05:53.720
What if we lose the case?

109
05:53.720 --> 05:55.080
We won't charge a single cent.

110
05:55.080 --> 05:55.920
But if we win,

111
05:55.920 --> 05:58.780
the fee will be a little higher than the market rate.

112
06:00.400 --> 06:01.280
Miss.

113
06:01.680 --> 06:02.720
I think it's fine.

114
06:03.160 --> 06:05.280
What he said is reasonable.

115
06:06.560 --> 06:07.360
Take care, Aunt Fang.

116
06:07.360 --> 06:09.020
Careful now. Watch your step.

117
06:10.000 --> 06:10.920
Have a safe trip back.

118
06:10.920 --> 06:11.920
Just wait for our news.

119
06:11.920 --> 06:12.800
Don't worry too much.

120
06:12.800 --> 06:15.000
Aunt Fang, call me if you need anything.

121
06:17.280 --> 06:19.940
We're definitely going to win this case, right?

122
06:20.040 --> 06:22.600
Who can guarantee a 100% win in these cases?

123
06:22.600 --> 06:23.280
I wouldn't dare.

124
06:23.280 --> 06:24.000
Understood.

125
06:24.000 --> 06:25.530
Lawyers have to be precise.

126
06:25.600 --> 06:27.000
Let me put it another way.

127
06:27.000 --> 06:30.280
Meaning, once we win this lawsuit...

128
06:30.360 --> 06:32.280
Does that mean out of the 300,000 contingency fee,

129
06:32.280 --> 06:33.360
I get 60,000?

130
06:34.040 --> 06:35.000
Is that all you think about?

131
06:35.000 --> 06:35.600
No.

132
06:35.600 --> 06:38.000
Don't worry. I keep my promise.

133
06:38.040 --> 06:40.120
Great. Let me just confirm.

134
06:40.720 --> 06:42.840
Once we win this case,

135
06:42.840 --> 06:45.370
does Dong Beihu get 60,000 out of the 300,000?

136
06:45.840 --> 06:47.240
Are you recording me?

137
06:47.280 --> 06:48.880
Applying what I've learned.

138
06:50.040 --> 06:51.370
Let me record it for you.

139
06:53.720 --> 06:54.380
Dong Beihu,

140
06:54.480 --> 06:55.720
you're such a dog.

141
06:55.720 --> 06:57.040
I knew it. I...

142
06:57.840 --> 06:59.159
You keep your promise, right?

143
06:59.159 --> 07:00.360
Promise, promise, promise.

144
07:00.360 --> 07:01.360
Okay. Come.

145
07:01.360 --> 07:02.240
Look at my promise too.

146
07:02.240 --> 07:03.240
What is it?

147
07:03.800 --> 07:06.000
As the marketing director of our company,

148
07:06.000 --> 07:08.040
I dedicated half of my minivan

149
07:08.040 --> 07:09.160
for our company to use.

150
07:09.160 --> 07:10.240
Since I only dedicated half of it,

151
07:10.240 --> 07:12.160
you only need to pay half the rent.

152
07:12.600 --> 07:13.840
Always finding ways to scam money.

153
07:13.840 --> 07:14.360
Come on.

154
07:14.360 --> 07:16.280
Who told you to print my phone number on it?

155
07:16.280 --> 07:17.280
It's for promotion.

156
07:17.280 --> 07:18.840
It's my privacy.

157
07:18.840 --> 07:20.360
See? Isn't it effective?

158
07:22.720 --> 07:23.720
Hello, Uncle Li.

159
07:24.720 --> 07:25.520
What's wrong?

160
07:26.920 --> 07:29.240
He wants to make a comeback. He's crazy.

161
07:29.240 --> 07:30.400
Uncle Li, pin him down for me.

162
07:30.400 --> 07:31.240
Pin him down.

163
07:31.240 --> 07:32.280
No, where are you going?

164
07:32.280 --> 07:33.600
Let's use the company car.

165
07:33.600 --> 07:34.840
No need. My little scooter is fine.

166
07:34.840 --> 07:36.159
No, if you don't use it,

167
07:36.159 --> 07:38.280
you have to reimburse me for the custom paint job.

168
07:38.280 --> 07:40.360
Expenses without prior consultation will not be reimbursed.

169
07:40.360 --> 07:42.480
If you don't like it, just scrape it off.

170
07:42.480 --> 07:43.810
Drive slowly. Let's go.

171
07:45.120 --> 07:45.600
I...

172
07:49.600 --> 07:50.840
Dajuan, let me tell you.

173
07:50.840 --> 07:53.360
The quality of this batch of drinks is top-notch.

174
07:53.360 --> 07:56.020
High sugar, guaranteed sweet, and tastes good.

175
07:56.040 --> 07:58.360
Brother Jun, with this color,

176
07:58.600 --> 08:00.800
are you sure it won't kill anyone who drinks it?

177
08:00.800 --> 08:01.530
Sister Juan.

178
08:01.800 --> 08:03.600
We've been delivering goods to you for so long.

179
08:03.600 --> 08:05.400
Don't you know our character?

180
08:05.400 --> 08:06.330
No, don't worry.

181
08:06.720 --> 08:08.040
It definitely won't kill anyone.

182
08:08.040 --> 08:09.240
We've done tests, you know.

183
08:09.240 --> 08:10.480
It's completely fine to drink.

184
08:10.480 --> 08:11.400
Guo the Fool's mahjong parlor,

185
08:11.400 --> 08:13.120
and Lao Si's arcade,

186
08:13.120 --> 08:14.480
are all going to use my drinks.

187
08:14.480 --> 08:15.240
You know?

188
08:15.360 --> 08:17.240
As long as you use this drink I exclusively represent,

189
08:17.240 --> 08:18.360
I guarantee your business will be safe.

190
08:18.360 --> 08:19.480
Absolutely safe.

191
08:19.680 --> 08:20.280
Absolutely safe.

192
08:20.280 --> 08:21.280
Stop pretending.

193
08:21.480 --> 08:23.080
What are you pretending for?

194
08:23.800 --> 08:25.000
You won't even dance.

195
08:25.040 --> 08:26.570
Come on, what are you doing?

196
08:26.920 --> 08:27.980
What are you doing?

197
08:28.600 --> 08:30.400
What the hell? What are you doing?

198
08:30.400 --> 08:31.460
What are you doing?

199
08:31.480 --> 08:32.360
What are you doing? What is this?

200
08:32.360 --> 08:32.840
What?

201
08:33.559 --> 08:34.280
What are you doing?

202
08:34.280 --> 08:36.120
What do you mean? Are you drunk?

203
08:36.280 --> 08:36.480
What's wrong?

204
08:36.480 --> 08:37.480
Disrespecting women?

205
08:37.480 --> 08:38.919
Being a busybody, huh?

206
08:39.159 --> 08:40.360
What are you saying here?

207
08:40.360 --> 08:41.799
What do you mean?

208
08:41.799 --> 08:42.280
Nothing.

209
08:42.280 --> 08:43.280
What's up?

210
08:46.280 --> 08:47.680
Brother, I was wrong.

211
08:49.240 --> 08:50.480
You, dance with me.

212
08:50.480 --> 08:51.480
No need, brother.

213
08:51.600 --> 08:52.360
Brother, I was wrong.

214
08:52.360 --> 08:54.400
Let me tell you, it's a society ruled by law now.

215
08:54.400 --> 08:55.720
In the past, I would have killed you.

216
08:55.720 --> 08:57.120
Who are you going to kill?

217
08:57.360 --> 08:58.040
Let go.

218
08:58.720 --> 08:59.840
I was wondering why

219
08:59.840 --> 09:01.240
my eye has been twitching so much these past two days.

220
09:01.240 --> 09:02.280
You're messing around here.

221
09:02.280 --> 09:03.840
Chief Li, Long.

222
09:03.840 --> 09:06.240
Today's incident really isn't your dad's fault.

223
09:06.240 --> 09:08.280
It's that guy who had a few too many drinks.

224
09:08.280 --> 09:09.600
He insisted that the little girl,

225
09:09.600 --> 09:11.280
no, that lady dance with him.

226
09:11.280 --> 09:12.480
When she refused, he hit her.

227
09:12.480 --> 09:14.480
Your dad was carrying out justice for heaven.

228
09:14.480 --> 09:16.280
No, he was acting courageously for a just cause.

229
09:16.280 --> 09:17.720
Right, it wasn't me. What was I doing?

230
09:17.720 --> 09:20.480
I was just talking business with Dajuan.

231
09:20.480 --> 09:21.410
Where is Dajuan?

232
09:21.840 --> 09:22.840
Dajuan, what Juan?

233
09:22.840 --> 09:23.840
Think about it carefully.

234
09:23.840 --> 09:24.360
Chief Li.

235
09:24.360 --> 09:25.800
Everyone stay there and don't move.

236
09:25.800 --> 09:26.730
Don't follow me.

237
09:26.840 --> 09:27.280
No.

238
09:28.000 --> 09:29.720
What are you doing? I can do it. Don't move.

239
09:29.720 --> 09:30.680
What do you mean you can do it?

240
09:30.680 --> 09:32.080
Don't follow me, you two.

241
09:32.480 --> 09:33.800
I'm not... I...

242
09:33.800 --> 09:35.200
I'm not disabled. You...

243
09:35.240 --> 09:36.800
What are you two doing?

244
09:36.800 --> 09:37.720
What are you doing?

245
09:37.720 --> 09:39.160
So many of my brothers were watching.

246
09:39.160 --> 09:40.600
You didn't give me any face at all.

247
09:40.600 --> 09:43.480
Of Leyang's Eight Great Guardians, five who can still move showed up.

248
09:43.480 --> 09:44.720
You put on quite a show.

249
09:44.720 --> 09:46.240
Look, never mind the size of my show.

250
09:46.240 --> 09:47.720
How did I get in your way?

251
09:47.720 --> 09:49.240
I was doing business up there.

252
09:49.240 --> 09:50.360
You call that doing business?

253
09:50.360 --> 09:51.920
I was promoting drinks. Isn't that doing business?

254
09:51.920 --> 09:53.160
Were you promoting drinks?

255
09:53.160 --> 09:54.360
You sell drinks to people,

256
09:54.360 --> 09:55.400
and then what?

257
09:55.400 --> 09:56.160
To keep them safe.

258
09:56.160 --> 09:57.480
Isn't this collecting protection fees in disguise?

259
09:57.480 --> 09:58.120
Who are you fooling?

260
09:58.120 --> 09:58.720
I was...

261
09:58.720 --> 10:00.240
Don't force me to go back to work.

262
10:00.240 --> 10:01.240
What 'you'? I'm your dad!

263
10:01.240 --> 10:02.600
If you really want to find a job,

264
10:02.600 --> 10:04.320
can't you find a proper one?

265
10:04.320 --> 10:05.840
Do you have to go back to your old ways?

266
10:05.840 --> 10:07.240
I have experience in helping released prisoners

267
10:07.240 --> 10:08.520
find jobs.

268
10:08.600 --> 10:09.240
Right.

269
10:12.320 --> 10:14.120
You two look like the real father and daughter.

270
10:14.120 --> 10:15.840
You two are putting on a double act here.

271
10:15.840 --> 10:17.600
I'm doing this to develop my career.

272
10:17.600 --> 10:19.320
Because she resigned and lost her job.

273
10:19.320 --> 10:21.580
How can you live without a stable income?

274
10:21.640 --> 10:22.840
Why are you dragging me into this?

275
10:22.840 --> 10:24.120
Don't drag me into this.

276
10:24.120 --> 10:25.240
If you get locked up again,

277
10:25.240 --> 10:26.360
we'll be completely stable.

278
10:26.360 --> 10:27.890
You'll be forced to behave.

279
10:28.440 --> 10:30.000
You don't know how to be grateful at all.

280
10:30.000 --> 10:31.320
Why are you going in there?

281
10:31.320 --> 10:32.600
I left my drink samples inside.

282
10:32.600 --> 10:33.860
I'm getting them back.

283
10:36.960 --> 10:37.600
Uncle Li,

284
10:37.840 --> 10:39.320
you still need to keep an eye on him.

285
10:39.320 --> 10:42.250
Don't worry. I've been watching him for half my life.

286
10:47.360 --> 10:48.820
What's wrong with you now?

287
10:51.600 --> 10:55.600
Look, it's a red radish now,

288
10:56.200 --> 10:59.000
but it might turn into a cigar in the future.

289
11:00.000 --> 11:01.600
As long as I win this case,

290
11:01.720 --> 11:04.000
I'll net 60,000 yuan.

291
11:05.720 --> 11:07.480
Bragging again.

292
11:08.440 --> 11:10.360
You can make 60,000 on your first case?

293
11:10.360 --> 11:11.240
Who would believe that?

294
11:11.240 --> 11:12.720
What's there to brag about?

295
11:12.720 --> 11:15.240
I'm telling you, I'm made for this job.

296
11:16.000 --> 11:17.120
This is just small potatoes.

297
11:17.120 --> 11:17.480
In the future,

298
11:17.480 --> 11:19.720
when I get a case worth tens or hundreds of millions,

299
11:19.720 --> 11:21.520
you'll ride my coattails to the top.

300
11:21.520 --> 11:23.080
You look like a dog to me.

301
11:23.080 --> 11:25.210
Don't take me with you when you ascend.

302
11:26.120 --> 11:28.120
I just beg you to be down-to-earth.

303
11:28.120 --> 11:29.000
If you stop causing trouble,

304
11:29.000 --> 11:30.240
I'll burn incense in gratitude.

305
11:30.240 --> 11:31.760
You'll definitely get to burn it.

306
11:31.760 --> 11:34.020
Burn a three-meter-tall incense stick.

307
11:34.480 --> 11:37.240
I burn incense to pray for my son

308
11:37.240 --> 11:39.120
to have a stable job

309
11:39.120 --> 11:41.600
and marry a good wife.

310
11:43.520 --> 11:44.980
You're being a bit greedy.

311
11:45.120 --> 11:47.120
I already have a stable job now,

312
11:47.240 --> 11:48.240
so why do I need a wife?

313
11:48.240 --> 11:49.240
I don't have the time these two years.

314
11:49.240 --> 11:51.440
Let's talk about it in a couple of years.

315
11:51.640 --> 11:54.840
Just eat your food. You're always like this.

316
11:58.840 --> 12:00.640
What do you think of Lawyer Xiao?

317
12:05.480 --> 12:06.010
What for?

318
12:11.000 --> 12:12.600
What do you think of Mr. Zhao?

319
12:15.000 --> 12:15.240
No.

320
12:15.240 --> 12:16.960
You're never serious.

321
12:17.120 --> 12:19.320
What do you think of Mr. Zhao's legs?

322
12:19.600 --> 12:22.060
It's fine. I'll just make money to treat him.

323
12:27.720 --> 12:28.240
Morning, Ruoqi.

324
12:28.240 --> 12:28.840
Morning.

325
12:29.360 --> 12:30.440
So shameless.

326
12:30.720 --> 12:31.480
Step aside.

327
12:31.600 --> 12:32.160
Morning.

328
12:33.840 --> 12:35.570
Good morning, Mr. Su, Mr. Ding.

329
12:36.240 --> 12:37.480
Morning, Ruoqi.

330
12:37.480 --> 12:38.720
I bought you some milk tea.

331
12:38.720 --> 12:39.880
I don't know if you like it.

332
12:39.880 --> 12:40.600
We do.

333
12:41.000 --> 12:42.000
Thanks, Ruoqi.

334
12:42.000 --> 12:42.880
You're welcome.

335
12:42.880 --> 12:43.720
This one is a bit cold.

336
12:43.720 --> 12:44.360
Okay.

337
12:44.480 --> 12:45.400
Here, Mr. Guo.

338
12:46.480 --> 12:47.120
Thanks.

339
12:47.880 --> 12:50.360
Ruoqi, this milk tea is so good.

340
12:50.480 --> 12:52.240
I've never had such good milk tea.

341
12:52.240 --> 12:53.440
You like it that much?

342
12:53.480 --> 12:54.840
I'll buy it for you again next time.

343
12:54.840 --> 12:55.600
Thanks.

344
12:59.720 --> 13:02.240
What's the difference between this and the one I bought you yesterday?

345
13:02.240 --> 13:03.840
There's a huge difference.

346
13:04.360 --> 13:05.720
None of you understand.

347
13:06.320 --> 13:07.240
I understand.

348
13:08.240 --> 13:09.480
I understand too.

349
13:10.240 --> 13:11.480
You all understand.

350
13:17.520 --> 13:18.650
I'll take this call.

351
13:19.840 --> 13:20.240
Hello.

352
13:21.240 --> 13:22.000
Zhang Guang.

353
13:23.440 --> 13:24.500
I'm free. Go ahead.

354
13:27.240 --> 13:27.840
Come in.

355
13:28.120 --> 13:29.360
Good morning, mentor.

356
13:29.360 --> 13:31.420
Watermelon Boba or Jasmine Milk Tea?

357
13:31.840 --> 13:32.840
Neither, thanks.

358
13:32.840 --> 13:33.840
You don't want either?

359
13:33.840 --> 13:35.440
Did you read the cases I sent you yesterday?

360
13:35.440 --> 13:36.120
I did.

361
13:36.120 --> 13:37.840
Debt enforcement for Shanyuan Bank.

362
13:37.840 --> 13:39.040
Eight cases in total.

363
13:39.600 --> 13:41.200
Tell me about Ma Chao's case.

364
13:43.000 --> 13:44.280
Ma Chao's case has dragged on

365
13:44.280 --> 13:45.480
the longest.

366
13:45.960 --> 13:47.240
Ma Chao and his wife, Feng Yan,

367
13:47.240 --> 13:49.520
mortgaged their house for a bank loan ten years ago.

368
13:49.520 --> 13:52.120
But they never repaid it in full according to the contract.

369
13:52.120 --> 13:55.180
They even had an out-of-court mediation two years ago.

370
13:55.480 --> 13:56.760
Compare the bank data as soon as possible

371
13:56.760 --> 13:57.720
and make a spreadsheet.

372
13:57.720 --> 13:59.200
Come to the court with me next week.

373
13:59.200 --> 13:59.880
Okay.

374
14:01.600 --> 14:04.080
Mentor, by the way,

375
14:04.360 --> 14:05.720
do we have any big cases

376
14:05.720 --> 14:07.250
involving gangs recently?

377
14:10.480 --> 14:11.410
I don't have any.

378
14:11.640 --> 14:13.300
Why don't you ask Lawyer Shen?

379
14:15.360 --> 14:16.600
Then I'll go prepare.

380
14:19.840 --> 14:22.000
Hello, Aunt Fang. I checked.

381
14:22.080 --> 14:23.520
The two properties under Wang Lijuan's name

382
14:23.520 --> 14:25.380
have never been mortgaged at all.

383
14:25.600 --> 14:28.000
She just doesn't want to pay back the money.

384
14:28.760 --> 14:29.320
How about this?

385
14:29.320 --> 14:31.320
Bring the documents and the litigation fee,

386
14:31.320 --> 14:33.320
and let's file the case first, okay?

387
14:33.520 --> 14:36.600
Lawyer Xiao, I have something to tell you.

388
14:36.600 --> 14:38.320
Let's meet at the teahouse.

389
14:40.200 --> 14:41.000
Okay.

390
15:00.480 --> 15:01.320
Thank you.

391
15:05.440 --> 15:06.240
It's a bit hot.

392
15:08.440 --> 15:09.320
Ms. Xiao.

393
15:13.760 --> 15:14.840
I'm sorry.

394
15:15.520 --> 15:16.840
I've made up my mind.

395
15:17.000 --> 15:18.640
I'm dropping the lawsuit.

396
15:18.760 --> 15:19.760
Dropping it?

397
15:20.360 --> 15:21.760
Why, Aunt Fang?

398
15:22.360 --> 15:25.090
You don't still consider her your friend, do you?

399
15:25.840 --> 15:28.320
You're already taking a risk with the legal fees.

400
15:28.320 --> 15:31.040
I didn't know I needed to pay court fees too.

401
15:31.480 --> 15:34.960
My pension is all used to pay the loan interest.

402
15:35.360 --> 15:38.120
I really can't afford the court fees.

403
15:38.120 --> 15:41.240
No, we can figure out the money issue.

404
15:41.600 --> 15:42.600
We'll find a way.

405
15:43.360 --> 15:44.960
But if you drop the lawsuit,

406
15:44.960 --> 15:46.480
the millions Wang Lijuan owes you

407
15:46.480 --> 15:47.720
will never be recovered.

408
15:47.720 --> 15:49.050
And when the time comes,

409
15:49.240 --> 15:50.900
the bank will take your house.

410
15:51.720 --> 15:54.240
Auntie, where will you and Grandma live?

411
15:54.720 --> 15:56.600
I'll rent a place first.

412
15:57.120 --> 15:58.480
I have my own two hands.

413
15:58.720 --> 16:00.720
I can work and earn money.

414
16:00.960 --> 16:03.290
I'm just sorry for letting you down, girl.

415
16:03.440 --> 16:06.720
This pot of tea is the only thing I can treat you to right now.

416
16:06.720 --> 16:08.840
Later, when I'm a bit better off,

417
16:09.360 --> 16:11.440
I will definitely repay this favor.

418
16:11.480 --> 16:12.440
But Auntie,

419
16:12.600 --> 16:14.060
have you thought about it?

420
16:14.120 --> 16:15.600
What kind of job will you find,

421
16:15.600 --> 16:16.480
and how long will you have to work

422
16:16.480 --> 16:18.200
to pay back those millions?

423
16:19.120 --> 16:21.720
This might just be a lesson in my life.

424
16:22.320 --> 16:23.320
What less...

425
16:27.880 --> 16:29.240
What kind of lesson?

426
16:29.840 --> 16:31.960
This should be a lesson for Wang Lijuan!

427
16:31.960 --> 16:33.560
She's bullying you too much.

428
16:34.000 --> 16:35.600
We have to teach her a lesson!

429
16:36.480 --> 16:38.440
You clearly just wanted to help her.

430
16:38.440 --> 16:40.080
What did you do wrong?

431
16:47.720 --> 16:48.600
Auntie Fang,

432
16:49.720 --> 16:50.840
do you trust me?

433
16:57.480 --> 16:58.360
What the hell?

434
16:58.480 --> 16:59.840
You paid the legal fees too?

435
16:59.840 --> 17:01.120
Well, let's get this straight.

436
17:01.120 --> 17:02.320
This money has nothing to do with me.

437
17:02.320 --> 17:04.359
How can it have nothing to do with you?

438
17:04.359 --> 17:05.880
You get 20% of the profits.

439
17:05.880 --> 17:07.319
But you have nothing to do with the losses?

440
17:07.319 --> 17:08.839
There's no such good deal in the world.

441
17:08.839 --> 17:09.520
Exactly.

442
17:09.520 --> 17:10.960
Risks must be shared.

443
17:11.119 --> 17:12.720
No, you should have discussed it with me.

444
17:12.720 --> 17:15.079
If we share the risks, I should have the right to know.

445
17:15.079 --> 17:16.119
Don't you know now?

446
17:16.119 --> 17:17.119
You know it now.

447
17:17.359 --> 17:18.760
So that's it.

448
17:20.839 --> 17:22.319
My goodness.

449
17:22.319 --> 17:24.839
You're a grown man, getting all worked up over this.

450
17:24.839 --> 17:26.359
Fine, I'll pay the money.

451
17:27.480 --> 17:28.960
It's not about who pays.

452
17:28.960 --> 17:29.480
Then you pay.

453
17:29.480 --> 17:30.480
I can't possibly pay.

454
17:30.480 --> 17:31.440
I don't have the means.

455
17:31.440 --> 17:33.200
I mean, what if something goes wrong?

456
17:33.200 --> 17:34.240
What about the losses?

457
17:34.240 --> 17:35.640
What could go wrong?

458
17:35.640 --> 17:37.000
What losses? With Sister Long here,

459
17:37.000 --> 17:38.200
what losses could you possibly have?

460
17:38.200 --> 17:39.120
Really. But Sister Long,

461
17:39.120 --> 17:40.080
you only have 20,000 yuan.

462
17:40.080 --> 17:41.200
If you really pay it,

463
17:41.200 --> 17:41.880
and something does happen...

464
17:41.880 --> 17:42.880
What's wrong with you guys?

465
17:42.880 --> 17:44.000
Why are you acting like him?

466
17:44.000 --> 17:45.240
Remember this.

467
17:45.240 --> 17:47.000
Your words are your feng shui.

468
17:47.160 --> 17:48.480
You need to avoid jinxing it, understand?

469
17:48.480 --> 17:49.520
Avoid what?

470
17:50.840 --> 17:51.640
Who is it?

471
17:51.720 --> 17:52.200
Coming.

472
17:52.200 --> 17:52.760
Who is it?

473
17:53.480 --> 17:54.240
Aunt Fang.

474
17:55.440 --> 17:57.000
Aunt Fang, what are you doing?

475
17:57.000 --> 17:58.840
You've helped me so much.

476
17:58.840 --> 18:00.720
I want to do what I can.

477
18:00.720 --> 18:02.000
No, no, you can't be serious.

478
18:02.000 --> 18:03.600
How can we let you do this?

479
18:04.720 --> 18:07.240
If you don't let me do something for you,

480
18:07.600 --> 18:09.530
I'd rather not fight this lawsuit.

481
18:11.440 --> 18:13.960
I hope you can understand me.

482
18:33.600 --> 18:34.480
Come in.

483
18:35.480 --> 18:36.140
Judge Wang.

484
18:36.920 --> 18:38.240
You're just in time.

485
18:38.240 --> 18:39.000
Hello.

486
18:39.240 --> 18:41.560
Ma Chao, hurry up and explain your repayment plan

487
18:41.560 --> 18:43.090
to Lawyer Li and the others.

488
18:43.920 --> 18:44.920
Come, have a seat.

489
18:47.000 --> 18:47.960
Hello, lawyers.

490
18:48.000 --> 18:50.000
We've already promised Judge Wang

491
18:50.080 --> 18:53.280
that we'll definitely pay off the money within two years.

492
18:53.880 --> 18:55.940
What is the basis for your repayment?

493
18:57.920 --> 19:00.480
I opened a factory before,

494
19:00.720 --> 19:02.240
making plastic films.

495
19:02.440 --> 19:05.240
But the profits haven't been good these past few years,

496
19:05.240 --> 19:07.500
so I haven't been able to pay off the loan.

497
19:07.560 --> 19:09.480
I went to the south a few days ago,

498
19:09.480 --> 19:12.080
and the people there really liked my products.

499
19:12.440 --> 19:13.920
There are already several clients

500
19:13.920 --> 19:15.440
who intend to place orders.

501
19:15.440 --> 19:16.480
Just an intention.

502
19:16.480 --> 19:17.610
No contract signed?

503
19:19.000 --> 19:21.000
We'll go there in the next couple of days

504
19:21.000 --> 19:22.280
and guarantee to get the contract signed.

505
19:22.280 --> 19:23.880
Yes, we'll sign it very soon.

506
19:25.400 --> 19:28.000
Here is the repayment record for the two of you over the past ten years.

507
19:28.000 --> 19:29.480
It clearly shows

508
19:29.680 --> 19:32.240
that you missed every single repayment.

509
19:32.480 --> 19:34.440
And the repayment ability you mentioned

510
19:34.440 --> 19:35.500
has no solid proof.

511
19:35.640 --> 19:37.240
Based on the current situation,

512
19:37.240 --> 19:39.720
the bank's application for a judicial auction of the mortgaged property

513
19:39.720 --> 19:41.480
is completely in accordance with the law.

514
19:41.480 --> 19:42.240
Attorney,

515
19:43.720 --> 19:45.240
I don't mind if you laugh,

516
19:46.200 --> 19:47.800
but the house we mortgaged

517
19:48.000 --> 19:50.260
actually belongs to my parents-in-law.

518
19:50.480 --> 19:51.920
The whole family lives in it.

519
19:51.920 --> 19:53.640
If this house is really sold,

520
19:54.200 --> 19:56.000
we will truly be homeless.

521
19:57.320 --> 19:58.040
Yes.

522
19:58.440 --> 20:00.840
Attorney Li, my parents are in poor health.

523
20:00.920 --> 20:02.480
They really can't take this kind of stress.

524
20:02.480 --> 20:04.400
Since you knew your parents were in poor health,

525
20:04.400 --> 20:06.000
when you mortgaged the house,

526
20:06.000 --> 20:07.680
why didn't you think it through?

527
20:07.680 --> 20:10.560
It was all for the business back then.

528
20:10.680 --> 20:13.200
Since you two are so confident in your business,

529
20:13.200 --> 20:14.480
we can just proceed as planned

530
20:14.480 --> 20:16.080
and auction the house first.

531
20:16.240 --> 20:17.400
When you make money later,

532
20:17.400 --> 20:19.880
you can buy a bigger house for your parents

533
20:20.400 --> 20:22.460
and let them enjoy their retirement.

534
20:22.720 --> 20:23.780
Right, Judge Wang?

535
20:26.960 --> 20:27.560
Lawyer Li.

536
20:28.000 --> 20:29.000
I think we can

537
20:29.000 --> 20:31.330
discuss an extension with the bank again.

538
20:32.560 --> 20:33.440
That's right.

539
20:33.560 --> 20:35.480
This young lawyer is absolutely right.

540
20:35.480 --> 20:36.720
Please give us a little more time.

541
20:36.720 --> 20:37.560
Thank you.

542
20:37.920 --> 20:38.560
I'm sorry.

543
20:39.080 --> 20:40.560
I have already communicated with the bank

544
20:40.560 --> 20:41.920
multiple times.

545
20:42.480 --> 20:44.000
The bank refused the extension.

546
20:44.000 --> 20:46.860
So you two should still prepare to vacate the house.

547
20:52.000 --> 20:53.240
You want to negotiate with the bank again.

548
20:53.240 --> 20:55.000
Is it because you sympathize with them?

549
20:55.000 --> 20:57.000
Yes, they look quite honest and pitiful.

550
20:57.000 --> 20:58.760
And they have an elderly person at home.

551
20:58.760 --> 21:00.800
You need to understand who we are representing.

552
21:00.800 --> 21:02.280
Our client is the bank.

553
21:02.440 --> 21:03.720
You must be clear about your stance.

554
21:03.720 --> 21:06.050
What if there is still room to fight for it?

555
21:09.000 --> 21:10.240
They are adults.

556
21:10.520 --> 21:12.800
Adults must take responsibility for their actions.

557
21:12.800 --> 21:14.680
And you must take responsibility for yours too.

558
21:14.680 --> 21:16.410
If we can't reach an agreement,

559
21:16.520 --> 21:19.520
it will also send the wrong message to the other party.

560
21:20.000 --> 21:20.800
Sorry, sorry.

561
21:21.680 --> 21:22.810
What a coincidence.

562
21:23.040 --> 21:24.920
You are Lawyer Xiao?

563
21:25.040 --> 21:26.170
Hello, Lawyer Xiao.

564
21:26.760 --> 21:27.480
Wang Ruoqi.

565
21:27.480 --> 21:28.000
Ruoqi.

566
21:28.000 --> 21:29.720
I'm interning in Master Li's team now.

567
21:29.720 --> 21:30.280
Who?

568
21:30.400 --> 21:31.200
Master Li.

569
21:32.320 --> 21:34.560
Master Li... Li...

570
21:35.480 --> 21:36.080
That's good.

571
21:36.080 --> 21:37.720
You are Director Wang's daughter, right?

572
21:37.720 --> 21:38.240
Yes.

573
21:38.240 --> 21:39.000
Nice to meet you.

574
21:39.000 --> 21:39.480
Nice to meet you.

575
21:39.480 --> 21:41.720
Then learn well from your Master Li.

576
21:41.760 --> 21:43.040
And gain some skills, right?

577
21:43.040 --> 21:44.570
Get back to work, Master Li.

578
21:44.720 --> 21:45.520
I'm leaving.

579
21:49.520 --> 21:51.560
Lawyer Xiao is so cool.

580
21:51.560 --> 21:53.800
No wonder she dares to challenge my dad.

581
21:54.480 --> 21:56.320
Master, are you two very close?

582
21:56.960 --> 21:58.620
Don't call me Master anymore.

583
21:58.760 --> 22:00.560
It sounds like instant noodles.

584
22:02.000 --> 22:03.720
Master, do you need an umbrella?

585
22:03.720 --> 22:04.720
Hold it yourself.

586
22:05.480 --> 22:07.280
This is the situation right now.

587
22:07.720 --> 22:09.520
Wang Lijuan isn't answering calls

588
22:09.520 --> 22:10.720
or replying to texts.

589
22:11.240 --> 22:13.080
We don't know where she's hiding.

590
22:13.080 --> 22:16.240
If all else fails, we'll have to serve by public notice.

591
22:16.400 --> 22:18.330
Wouldn't that take another month?

592
22:19.200 --> 22:21.240
Aunt Fang's loan is overdue.

593
22:21.240 --> 22:22.360
The bank has already filed a lawsuit.

594
22:22.360 --> 22:24.690
They could take back the house at any time.

595
22:26.000 --> 22:27.880
Aunt Fang can't afford to wait.

596
22:31.560 --> 22:32.240
Xiao Li.

597
22:33.080 --> 22:34.480
If I can corner her,

598
22:34.800 --> 22:36.560
can you rush over to serve the papers?

599
22:36.560 --> 22:38.290
Of course you can, Lawyer Xiao.

600
22:38.320 --> 22:40.560
If you catch them, call me anytime.

601
22:40.760 --> 22:42.480
I'll bring the body camera over.

602
22:42.480 --> 22:44.540
I'll try to ensure a smooth delivery.

603
22:45.760 --> 22:47.720
Excuse me, I'm looking for someone.

604
22:47.720 --> 22:49.640
Has Wang Lijuan come back recently?

605
22:49.640 --> 22:50.560
Who is Wang Lijuan?

606
22:50.560 --> 22:52.720
I think she's that tall woman.

607
23:00.240 --> 23:01.480
Is Wang Lijuan home?

608
23:01.560 --> 23:03.040
The one you're talking about is Zhao Lijuan.

609
23:03.040 --> 23:04.720
The chubby one is Wang Lijuan.

610
23:04.720 --> 23:06.480
The chubby one is Zhang Lijuan.

611
23:06.480 --> 23:07.480
Zhang Lijuan.

612
23:08.480 --> 23:09.480
She doesn't live here.

613
23:09.480 --> 23:10.480
I'm just renting.

614
23:11.000 --> 23:12.000
Then how about this.

615
23:12.000 --> 23:12.960
Give her a call.

616
23:12.960 --> 23:13.800
Ask her to come over.

617
23:13.800 --> 23:14.960
Just say there's a leak upstairs.

618
23:14.960 --> 23:17.090
Who are you? Why should I listen to you?

619
23:22.520 --> 23:23.720
Is this Aunt Wang?

620
23:23.880 --> 23:24.680
Wang Lijuan?

621
23:24.800 --> 23:25.560
Who is it?

622
23:26.000 --> 23:27.800
I'm from the courier station.

623
23:27.800 --> 23:29.040
You have a package,

624
23:29.040 --> 23:30.480
but the address is wrong.

625
23:30.480 --> 23:31.720
I want to ask for your new address

626
23:31.720 --> 23:32.720
so I can deliver it to you.

627
23:32.720 --> 23:34.850
Scammers' whole families should die.

628
23:36.000 --> 23:36.680
Are you done?

629
23:36.680 --> 23:37.610
What do you want?

630
23:38.720 --> 23:39.280
Buddy.

631
23:40.160 --> 23:41.680
Can you make a call for me now?

632
23:41.680 --> 23:43.280
I'm looking for Wang Lijuan.

633
23:50.400 --> 23:51.130
Lawyer Xiao.

634
23:51.200 --> 23:53.240
The bank called me again today.

635
23:53.400 --> 23:54.960
Aunt Fang, don't worry.

636
23:54.960 --> 23:56.490
I'll figure something out.

637
24:26.520 --> 24:27.240
Dong Beihu.

638
24:27.400 --> 24:28.000
What?

639
24:28.480 --> 24:29.010
Let's go.

640
24:29.240 --> 24:29.960
Where to?

641
24:30.000 --> 24:31.000
To catch someone.

642
24:32.720 --> 24:34.780
See, you still need my car, don't you?

643
24:34.880 --> 24:35.680
Get on my bike.

644
24:36.520 --> 24:37.450
My bike is agile.

645
24:38.080 --> 24:40.010
Agile for what? Where are we going?

646
24:40.040 --> 24:42.000
Wait, can this bike carry a passenger?

647
24:42.000 --> 24:43.040
I'm quite heavy.

648
24:43.720 --> 24:44.240
Slow down.

649
24:44.240 --> 24:45.880
Tell me before you start moving.

650
24:45.880 --> 24:46.760
Starting now.

651
24:49.280 --> 24:51.040
How do you know Zhang Guang is here?

652
24:51.040 --> 24:52.000
Don't worry about it.

653
24:52.000 --> 24:53.440
I just know.

654
24:53.440 --> 24:54.680
Play support for me later.

655
24:54.680 --> 24:56.200
Don't worry, I'm the best at playing support.

656
24:56.200 --> 24:57.530
I'll catch him for sure.

657
24:58.640 --> 25:00.100
Is that Zhang Guang's car?

658
25:01.920 --> 25:02.440
It really is.

659
25:02.440 --> 25:03.520
Quick, speed up.

660
25:03.640 --> 25:05.680
Don't hit me, I got it.

661
25:05.680 --> 25:07.880
Quick, charge, charge!

662
25:16.640 --> 25:17.480
Lie down. Quick.

663
25:17.480 --> 25:18.960
Lie on your stomach.

664
25:20.000 --> 25:21.480
Are you okay, Huzi?

665
25:21.720 --> 25:22.200
Huzi.

666
25:22.200 --> 25:22.880
Get out.

667
25:22.880 --> 25:24.000
How do you drive?

668
25:24.000 --> 25:24.720
You hit someone.

669
25:24.720 --> 25:25.480
Come on, give us an explanation.

670
25:25.480 --> 25:26.280
I hit you?

671
25:26.280 --> 25:27.240
How do you ride?

672
25:27.240 --> 25:28.240
How do you drive?

673
25:28.240 --> 25:29.720
Look, he can't even get up.

674
25:29.720 --> 25:31.240
I was two meters away from you.

675
25:31.240 --> 25:33.000
You hit us from two meters away.

676
25:33.040 --> 25:34.240
Are you trying to scam me?

677
25:34.240 --> 25:35.240
What did we scam you out of?

678
25:35.240 --> 25:36.560
I've seen this kind of thing a lot.

679
25:36.560 --> 25:37.640
I don't have time for you.

680
25:37.640 --> 25:38.500
Get out of here.

681
25:41.160 --> 25:41.640
Don't touch me.

682
25:41.640 --> 25:42.160
I'm telling you,

683
25:42.160 --> 25:43.040
if you touch me again, I'll call the police.

684
25:43.040 --> 25:44.040
Call them. You call them.

685
25:44.040 --> 25:44.480
I'll call them too.

686
25:44.480 --> 25:45.680
Whoever doesn't call is a coward.

687
25:45.680 --> 25:46.640
I'll take a picture first.

688
25:46.640 --> 25:47.480
You think I'm afraid of you?

689
25:47.480 --> 25:48.410
Take it. Take it.

690
25:48.440 --> 25:49.480
Are you okay, Huzi?

691
25:49.480 --> 25:50.960
I'm not even married yet, and my back is broken.

692
25:50.960 --> 25:51.720
Is this 110?

693
25:52.240 --> 25:53.640
I'll ask you one more time.

694
25:53.640 --> 25:54.880
Did he hit you or not?

695
25:54.880 --> 25:56.760
If it's proven that you're deliberately scamming,

696
25:56.760 --> 25:58.680
you'll have to take full responsibility.

697
25:58.680 --> 26:00.200
Well, officer,

698
26:00.200 --> 26:00.880
It's like this.

699
26:00.880 --> 26:02.680
I tend to forget things when I'm anxious.

700
26:02.680 --> 26:03.480
Let me think.

701
26:03.480 --> 26:04.610
Yes, think about it.

702
26:05.960 --> 26:06.760
Who are you?

703
26:07.240 --> 26:09.000
Keep acting, you two.

704
26:09.200 --> 26:11.240
Hurry up and arrest them both. Do society a favor.

705
26:11.240 --> 26:12.640
Come on, show me your driver's license.

706
26:12.640 --> 26:14.100
I have a driver's license.

707
26:14.640 --> 26:16.170
I'm a law-abiding citizen.

708
26:18.480 --> 26:20.000
Hurry up.

709
26:20.200 --> 26:21.200
Come here, quick.

710
26:23.240 --> 26:25.520
Hello, I'm from the court.

711
26:26.080 --> 26:26.640
Here.

712
26:30.000 --> 26:32.320
Identity confirmed as Zhang Guang.

713
26:32.680 --> 26:35.340
The court is now lawfully serving you a summons.

714
26:36.560 --> 26:38.440
This is my mom's summons. It has nothing to do with me.

715
26:38.440 --> 26:39.320
I can't find her either.

716
26:39.320 --> 26:40.450
The one underneath.

717
26:42.360 --> 26:44.000
You must arrive at the location on time.

718
26:44.000 --> 26:45.240
Look closely.

719
26:45.720 --> 26:47.000
You are a co-defendant.

720
26:47.000 --> 26:49.930
One for each of you. Don't fight over it with your mom.

721
26:53.720 --> 26:54.800
You... you two.

722
26:55.000 --> 26:56.280
It's too late.

723
26:56.960 --> 26:58.480
If they obstruct us again,

724
26:58.480 --> 27:00.480
I will apply for court enforcement.

725
27:01.720 --> 27:02.480
Lawyer Li.

726
27:02.720 --> 27:03.450
How did it go?

727
27:03.680 --> 27:05.280
Ma Chao and Feng Yan

728
27:05.640 --> 27:07.160
pushed the old couple out front.

729
27:07.160 --> 27:08.480
They are quite old,

730
27:08.720 --> 27:09.920
so we don't dare to use force.

731
27:09.920 --> 27:10.720
What do you think?

732
27:10.720 --> 27:11.800
Well, you guys go back first.

733
27:11.800 --> 27:13.040
I'll go talk to them again.

734
27:13.040 --> 27:15.160
If that doesn't work, we'll take legal action.

735
27:15.160 --> 27:15.800
Okay.

736
27:25.520 --> 27:26.240
Sir, ma'am.

737
27:28.240 --> 27:29.000
Hello.

738
27:38.480 --> 27:39.720
You two live here?

739
27:40.760 --> 27:41.480
In this room.

740
27:41.480 --> 27:43.280
This room is quite big, isn't it?

741
27:43.760 --> 27:45.040
Lawyer Li, Lawyer Wang.

742
27:45.040 --> 27:46.000
Mr. Ma, Mrs. Ma.

743
27:46.000 --> 27:46.930
Have some water.

744
27:48.240 --> 27:49.480
Please sit down.

745
27:50.000 --> 27:50.480
Well,

746
27:50.880 --> 27:51.800
Lawyer Li,

747
27:52.000 --> 27:54.160
you've seen our family's situation.

748
27:55.160 --> 27:57.240
It doesn't matter what happens to us,

749
27:57.480 --> 27:59.400
but my parents are too old.

750
27:59.680 --> 28:01.000
Please think of a way.

751
28:02.240 --> 28:03.240
Lawyer,

752
28:03.720 --> 28:04.960
we two old folks

753
28:05.400 --> 28:06.960
are not unreasonable people.

754
28:06.960 --> 28:07.480
Right.

755
28:07.480 --> 28:09.640
We know that paying back debts

756
28:10.400 --> 28:12.400
is perfectly justified.

757
28:12.720 --> 28:15.200
But we really have nowhere to go.

758
28:15.800 --> 28:17.800
You can't let us sleep on the streets

759
28:18.480 --> 28:19.720
or under a bridge.

760
28:21.240 --> 28:22.000
Sir, ma'am.

761
28:22.000 --> 28:23.680
I understand your thoughts.

762
28:23.920 --> 28:24.680
But we still have to

763
28:24.680 --> 28:26.640
move forward with this matter.

764
28:26.640 --> 28:28.680
I have a suggestion for you.

765
28:28.960 --> 28:29.440
You can temporarily

766
28:29.440 --> 28:32.400
rent a place to live.

767
28:32.400 --> 28:34.080
After this house is auctioned,

768
28:34.080 --> 28:35.240
with the remaining balance,

769
28:35.240 --> 28:36.480
you can choose to

770
28:36.480 --> 28:37.960
buy a smaller one

771
28:38.080 --> 28:39.640
or continue renting.

772
28:40.000 --> 28:41.600
You've seen our conditions.

773
28:41.960 --> 28:43.420
We don't have any savings.

774
28:43.960 --> 28:45.480
My small pension

775
28:45.480 --> 28:47.680
is only enough for our living expenses.

776
28:47.960 --> 28:49.240
How can we afford to rent a place?

777
28:49.240 --> 28:49.720
Right.

778
28:49.720 --> 28:52.000
Lawyer Li, I beg you.

779
28:52.400 --> 28:54.000
Please help us think of a way.

780
28:54.200 --> 28:56.000
My parents are 80 years old

781
28:56.240 --> 28:57.300
and in poor health.

782
28:57.920 --> 28:59.480
If they don't even have a place to live,

783
28:59.480 --> 29:00.960
how can they survive?

784
29:01.920 --> 29:03.000
Mr. Ma, Mrs. Ma.

785
29:03.000 --> 29:03.720
Sir, ma'am.

786
29:03.960 --> 29:05.160
We are not here

787
29:05.680 --> 29:07.440
to cause you trouble today.

788
29:08.200 --> 29:10.480
Supporting the elderly is your obligation.

789
29:10.480 --> 29:11.240
We are just here

790
29:11.240 --> 29:13.370
to collect this property for the bank.

791
29:13.560 --> 29:15.560
Let's keep it decent for each other,

792
29:15.560 --> 29:16.000
right?

793
29:16.200 --> 29:17.480
If you refuse to comply,

794
29:17.480 --> 29:18.640
we will have to

795
29:18.640 --> 29:20.720
apply to the court for compulsory execution.

796
29:20.720 --> 29:22.040
Who will suffer then?

797
29:22.040 --> 29:23.280
Won't it be the elderly?

798
29:23.280 --> 29:24.040
Right?

799
29:30.400 --> 29:31.920
How about this, you two?

800
29:32.200 --> 29:33.080
A friend of mine

801
29:33.080 --> 29:34.400
has an empty house

802
29:34.400 --> 29:35.760
that is unoccupied all year round.

803
29:35.760 --> 29:37.520
You can borrow it to live in for now.

804
29:37.520 --> 29:39.120
When this house is auctioned

805
29:39.400 --> 29:40.660
and the money arrives,

806
29:40.720 --> 29:42.000
you can pay the rent.

807
29:42.800 --> 29:44.130
The rent is negotiable.

808
29:44.200 --> 29:45.640
We just need to sign an agreement.

809
29:45.640 --> 29:46.320
For such an important matter,

810
29:46.320 --> 29:48.680
you need to discuss it with your friend first.

811
29:48.680 --> 29:49.560
I know this friend very well.

812
29:49.560 --> 29:50.720
He won't mind.

813
29:50.880 --> 29:52.080
Don't worry, you two.

814
29:52.400 --> 29:54.400
The house has good facilities

815
29:54.400 --> 29:55.730
and is well maintained.

816
29:57.760 --> 29:59.720
Um, Mom and Dad,

817
30:00.040 --> 30:02.480
moving is quite a hassle.

818
30:02.560 --> 30:05.000
Can you two handle it physically?

819
30:05.440 --> 30:05.960
Yeah.

820
30:05.960 --> 30:07.800
Look at all the stuff we have.

821
30:08.040 --> 30:09.500
Why don't you reconsider?

822
30:09.760 --> 30:11.360
What's there to reconsider?

823
30:11.480 --> 30:14.000
The lawyer has already made it clear.

824
30:14.560 --> 30:17.040
We shouldn't make things difficult for him.

825
30:17.720 --> 30:18.560
Yeah.

826
30:19.040 --> 30:20.570
Let's just leave it at that.

827
30:23.440 --> 30:24.720
Doesn't this solve it?

828
30:25.520 --> 30:27.240
Did I do a good job this time?

829
30:27.480 --> 30:29.280
You handled it very thoroughly.

830
30:31.920 --> 30:34.040
Making this decision so impulsively,

831
30:34.040 --> 30:34.920
aren't you afraid of bringing

832
30:34.920 --> 30:36.160
unnecessary trouble to your friend?

833
30:36.160 --> 30:38.480
No. Isn't there a lease agreement?

834
30:40.040 --> 30:40.800
Besides,

835
30:41.320 --> 30:42.720
they can't really force the two elderly people

836
30:42.720 --> 30:44.920
out onto the street to enforce it, right?

837
30:44.920 --> 30:46.920
That's too pitiful and inhumane.

838
30:47.160 --> 30:49.240
So you think my approach is not humane enough?

839
30:49.240 --> 30:52.680
At least it's conservative, rigid, and unreasonable.

840
30:53.000 --> 30:53.680
As lawyers,

841
30:53.680 --> 30:55.410
although we serve our clients,

842
30:55.600 --> 30:56.000
we can't be

843
30:56.000 --> 30:58.280
completely led by the nose by their demands.

844
30:58.280 --> 30:59.680
We should have our own attitude

845
30:59.680 --> 31:00.880
and our own judgment.

846
31:02.600 --> 31:03.520
You're right.

847
31:04.320 --> 31:05.720
I accept your criticism.

848
31:05.800 --> 31:07.460
I'll reflect on it carefully.

849
31:07.560 --> 31:08.800
Since you care so much,

850
31:08.800 --> 31:10.960
I'll leave the follow-up of this case to you.

851
31:10.960 --> 31:11.760
Really?

852
31:11.840 --> 31:13.280
I get to do it independently?

853
31:13.280 --> 31:14.200
You trust me?

854
31:14.800 --> 31:17.330
What's important is that you trust yourself.

855
31:24.040 --> 31:26.570
Recently, Mr. Chen from Shengkang Insurance

856
31:26.760 --> 31:29.800
wants to replace his entire legal team.

857
31:30.200 --> 31:30.920
Director,

858
31:31.080 --> 31:32.010
let me handle it.

859
31:32.280 --> 31:34.320
I've had drinks with Mr. Chen many times.

860
31:34.320 --> 31:37.040
Mr. Chen is a man of passion.

861
31:37.280 --> 31:38.840
He really loves to drink heavily.

862
31:38.840 --> 31:40.570
Lawyer Li doesn't drink a drop.

863
31:40.760 --> 31:41.480
Would that be a problem?

864
31:41.480 --> 31:42.200
Director, it's like this.

865
31:42.200 --> 31:44.080
Shengkang Insurance's total payouts last quarter

866
31:44.080 --> 31:45.040
were 780 million.

867
31:45.040 --> 31:46.770
The number of claims was 9,300,

868
31:46.920 --> 31:49.040
up 20.3% year-on-year.

869
31:49.480 --> 31:51.200
If we can secure this project,

870
31:51.200 --> 31:54.600
it will bring Honghu 5.6 million in revenue.

871
31:54.960 --> 31:56.760
Mr. Chen does love to drink,

872
31:57.120 --> 31:59.960
but he is even more rigorous about business.

873
31:59.960 --> 32:00.680
Yes.

874
32:01.560 --> 32:02.800
Mr. Chen is someone

875
32:03.480 --> 32:04.800
who clearly separates business from personal matters.

876
32:04.800 --> 32:08.080
I think we still need to use our professionalism

877
32:08.240 --> 32:09.680
to earn their trust.

878
32:15.240 --> 32:15.970
Attorney Li.

879
32:16.600 --> 32:18.920
You really made a brilliant move.

880
32:20.000 --> 32:21.240
What move did I make?

881
32:21.440 --> 32:22.520
Ruoqi.

882
32:23.280 --> 32:24.440
Isn't she with you?

883
32:24.920 --> 32:27.380
Then the director must take good care of her.

884
32:37.360 --> 32:39.160
Aunt Fang, you can just sit here.

885
32:39.440 --> 32:40.100
Right here.

886
32:51.400 --> 32:52.460
Where should I sit?

887
32:52.960 --> 32:54.690
In the presiding judge's seat.

888
32:55.320 --> 32:57.120
Long time no see, Attorney Xiao.

889
32:57.880 --> 33:00.360
What's wrong? Is Honghu not doing well lately?

890
33:00.360 --> 33:02.220
Taking on all kinds of dirty work?

891
33:08.640 --> 33:11.080
Just sit and rest. Just listen.

892
33:11.160 --> 33:12.760
Leave everything here to me.

893
33:17.440 --> 33:19.000
This case is quite clear.

894
33:19.000 --> 33:20.200
It's best to mediate.

895
33:20.240 --> 33:22.480
Reaching an agreement will save time.

896
33:22.480 --> 33:24.920
Do both parties accept mediation?

897
33:24.960 --> 33:26.320
Yes.

898
33:26.840 --> 33:30.300
Then please ask the other party when they will repay the money.

899
33:30.800 --> 33:31.800
Your Honor.

900
33:32.040 --> 33:35.520
Can I have a few words with the plaintiff, Ms. Fang?

901
33:38.120 --> 33:38.560
Huilan.

902
33:38.560 --> 33:40.290
You can just sit down and speak.

903
33:43.560 --> 33:44.360
Huilan.

904
33:44.680 --> 33:47.480
We've known each other for almost 60 years, right?

905
33:48.520 --> 33:49.480
I never thought

906
33:49.480 --> 33:52.320
we'd meet in a place like this today.

907
33:52.720 --> 33:55.320
My heartache is beyond words.

908
33:55.840 --> 33:58.840
Huilan, do you remember when we were little,

909
33:58.840 --> 34:00.700
how we played together every day?

910
34:00.840 --> 34:02.960
I waited for you after school every day,

911
34:02.960 --> 34:04.420
and we went home together.

912
34:04.880 --> 34:06.000
Do you remember?

913
34:06.280 --> 34:08.840
If we had one piece of candy, we'd break it in half,

914
34:08.840 --> 34:10.100
one half for each of us.

915
34:10.800 --> 34:12.679
You don't remember these beautiful memories?

916
34:12.679 --> 34:15.540
Right. That piece of candy was yours too, wasn't it?

917
34:17.600 --> 34:19.840
You can't be heartless.

918
34:20.000 --> 34:21.800
You can't just focus on money.

919
34:22.360 --> 34:23.199
Look at you,

920
34:23.199 --> 34:25.260
putting decades of friendship aside

921
34:25.639 --> 34:28.280
and hiring a lawyer to scam your godson.

922
34:28.280 --> 34:30.360
Ms. Wang, this is a court of law,

923
34:30.360 --> 34:32.800
not a stage for you to distort the truth.

924
34:33.120 --> 34:35.120
You owe money and still think you're right,

925
34:35.120 --> 34:36.440
and you even accuse my client.

926
34:36.440 --> 34:37.719
Is this your deep sisterly bond?

927
34:37.719 --> 34:39.760
Exactly. Isn't this just shameless?

928
34:39.760 --> 34:41.000
Who are you calling shameless?

929
34:41.000 --> 34:41.320
You uneducated brat!

930
34:41.320 --> 34:43.040
Silence in the gallery.

931
34:43.239 --> 34:44.159
I'm sorry, Your Honor.

932
34:44.159 --> 34:45.400
The defendant is avoiding the main issue

933
34:45.400 --> 34:48.000
and confusing the public with irrelevant memories.

934
34:48.000 --> 34:50.530
We strongly request to terminate her speech.

935
34:51.040 --> 34:53.840
Defendant, do not make statements irrelevant to this case.

936
34:53.840 --> 34:55.960
Auntie, say no more.

937
35:00.200 --> 35:01.040
Your Honor,

938
35:01.680 --> 35:04.040
since the defendant has no sincerity in mediation,

939
35:04.040 --> 35:05.600
we have no desire to mediate either.

940
35:05.600 --> 35:07.130
Counsel for the plaintiff,

941
35:07.280 --> 35:08.080
our side is...

942
35:08.080 --> 35:09.410
No, what does this mean?

943
35:10.440 --> 35:13.440
Fang Huilan, I really didn't expect this.

944
35:13.440 --> 35:15.320
You usually pretend to be generous,

945
35:15.320 --> 35:17.120
but you're so vicious deep down.

946
35:17.200 --> 35:18.280
Just for some money,

947
35:18.280 --> 35:19.960
are you trying to drive someone to their death?

948
35:19.960 --> 35:21.080
What are you doing?

949
35:21.320 --> 35:21.760
You...

950
35:23.600 --> 35:24.840
Aunt Fang, calm down.

951
35:24.840 --> 35:26.360
Wang Lijuan.

952
35:28.280 --> 35:31.000
How can you blame me instead?

953
35:31.440 --> 35:32.600
How can you...

954
35:33.680 --> 35:35.960
How can you blame me?

955
35:37.200 --> 35:39.040
Aunt Fang, are you okay?

956
35:39.040 --> 35:40.440
Aunt Fang, what happened?

957
35:40.440 --> 35:41.000
Don't take it to heart.

958
35:41.000 --> 35:41.440
What's wrong?

959
35:41.440 --> 35:42.080
Sit down quickly.

960
35:42.080 --> 35:43.880
You look like a mop, talking over there.

961
35:43.880 --> 35:45.520
Do you need medicine? I have some here, Agent.

962
35:45.520 --> 35:46.760
Don't be angry. Don't be angry.

963
35:46.760 --> 35:47.840
Hold her up.

964
35:48.040 --> 35:48.520
Keep an eye on her.

965
35:48.520 --> 35:49.160
Go, go, go.

966
35:49.160 --> 35:49.880
Watch carefully.

967
35:49.880 --> 35:50.840
Don't worry. Don't worry.

968
35:50.840 --> 35:51.520
Are you okay?

969
35:51.520 --> 35:52.160
You will get your retribution.

970
35:52.160 --> 35:53.800
Your Honor, the plaintiff is in this condition.

971
35:53.800 --> 35:54.880
Are we still proceeding with the trial?

972
35:54.880 --> 35:56.520
I understand the details of the case.

973
35:56.520 --> 35:57.780
The trial can proceed.

974
35:59.520 --> 36:00.080
Sit down.

975
36:06.040 --> 36:08.520
Ma Chao's family has officially moved out of the old house.

976
36:08.520 --> 36:10.720
The house will enter the judicial auction process this week.

977
36:10.720 --> 36:12.120
Everything is going smoothly.

978
36:12.120 --> 36:13.450
It's all under control.

979
36:14.080 --> 36:16.080
Good job keeping it under control. Keep it up.

980
36:16.080 --> 36:18.000
The non-disclosure agreement for Qiming Technology,

981
36:18.000 --> 36:19.600
I have finished drafting it.

982
36:21.520 --> 36:22.200
I'm sorry.

983
36:22.600 --> 36:23.000
I'm late.

984
36:23.000 --> 36:24.000
I just had a trial.

985
36:26.600 --> 36:28.960
Why the long face? What's wrong?

986
36:29.200 --> 36:31.960
I actually went up against Xiao Longnv in court today.

987
36:31.960 --> 36:33.040
What a coincidence.

988
36:33.040 --> 36:35.320
Her temper is still so bad, and her tongue is still so sharp.

989
36:35.320 --> 36:36.440
She totally roasted me.

990
36:36.440 --> 36:37.440
What kind of case?

991
36:38.160 --> 36:39.490
A private lending case.

992
36:39.640 --> 36:41.160
An elementary school classmate of mine and his mom

993
36:41.160 --> 36:42.720
borrowed some money from someone.

994
36:42.720 --> 36:44.160
And then they didn't want to pay it back.

995
36:44.160 --> 36:45.820
Isn't that really unethical?

996
36:46.440 --> 36:47.970
It's extremely unethical.

997
36:48.080 --> 36:48.920
I didn't want to take it either.

998
36:48.920 --> 36:50.250
But they kept calling me

999
36:50.640 --> 36:51.240
and telling me

1000
36:51.240 --> 36:53.760
that they didn't expect to win and just wanted to stall for time.

1001
36:53.760 --> 36:54.800
You should still focus your energy

1002
36:54.800 --> 36:55.880
on meaningful cases.

1003
36:55.880 --> 36:57.940
Otherwise, it's just a waste of time.

1004
36:58.360 --> 36:59.000
Go on.

1005
37:00.280 --> 37:01.080
Coming.

1006
37:08.160 --> 37:09.280
Aunt Fang, hurry.

1007
37:09.280 --> 37:10.560
Sit down, sit down.

1008
37:10.560 --> 37:11.280
Just lie down.

1009
37:11.280 --> 37:12.320
Lawyer Xiao.

1010
37:12.640 --> 37:14.480
Our trial went smoothly.

1011
37:14.800 --> 37:17.240
We just need to wait for the winning verdict.

1012
37:17.240 --> 37:17.640
Yes.

1013
37:17.720 --> 37:18.440
Right now,

1014
37:18.880 --> 37:21.800
the most important thing is to take care of your health.

1015
37:21.800 --> 37:24.060
I just regret trusting the wrong person.

1016
37:24.760 --> 37:27.480
Otherwise, I wouldn't have ended up like this

1017
37:27.880 --> 37:29.440
and implicated my mom.

1018
37:30.840 --> 37:34.640
Who hasn't trusted the wrong person in their life?

1019
37:37.160 --> 37:38.290
Slow down, Grandma.

1020
37:39.360 --> 37:41.090
Since things have come to this,

1021
37:41.760 --> 37:44.000
don't be too hard on yourself.

1022
37:48.920 --> 37:50.000
Huilan,

1023
37:50.680 --> 37:53.800
not only do we have to hold on,

1024
37:54.560 --> 37:57.920
but we also have to fight this lawsuit to the end.

1025
37:59.880 --> 38:00.880
Attorney Xiao,

1026
38:01.320 --> 38:03.880
my daughter is kind-hearted

1027
38:04.600 --> 38:05.960
and easily swayed.

1028
38:06.280 --> 38:08.600
She was so focused on helping others

1029
38:09.520 --> 38:11.960
that she ended up trapping herself.

1030
38:12.520 --> 38:17.960
I'll have to trouble you with this lawsuit.

1031
38:18.200 --> 38:19.720
It's my duty.

1032
38:38.680 --> 38:39.400
Sister.

1033
38:39.600 --> 38:41.600
The verdict is out. We won the case.

1034
38:42.800 --> 38:44.330
When will the money arrive?

1035
38:44.480 --> 38:45.600
Do you have a switch or something?

1036
38:45.600 --> 38:47.200
You bounce up whenever money is mentioned.

1037
38:47.200 --> 38:48.160
No, what are you talking about?

1038
38:48.160 --> 38:49.600
Isn't the lawsuit for money?

1039
38:49.600 --> 38:51.640
What's wrong with asking when it will arrive?

1040
38:51.640 --> 38:52.570
It won't arrive.

1041
38:52.960 --> 38:53.960
Wang Lijuan appealed again.

1042
38:53.960 --> 38:55.560
Wang Lijuan appealed again.

1043
38:55.840 --> 38:58.280
Why is it taking so long?

1044
38:58.400 --> 39:00.240
Isn't it just about paying back the debt?

1045
39:00.240 --> 39:01.920
Will it take until my 80th birthday?

1046
39:01.920 --> 39:03.600
Live to 80 first.

1047
39:04.320 --> 39:05.250
Come, let me see.

1048
39:05.760 --> 39:06.400
Let me see.

1049
39:06.400 --> 39:07.000
I...

1050
39:16.160 --> 39:17.620
What's wrong with you now?

1051
39:18.480 --> 39:19.810
My temper is flaring up.

1052
39:20.120 --> 39:21.600
Hold it in.

1053
39:22.520 --> 39:23.440
I can't hold it in.

1054
39:23.440 --> 39:24.370
You guys hold it.

1055
39:39.000 --> 39:40.000
Get out of the car.

1056
39:40.120 --> 39:41.320
Get out. Come on.

1057
39:41.320 --> 39:41.850
Come out.

1058
39:42.200 --> 39:43.800
No, no, no.

1059
39:44.960 --> 39:45.560
You hit my waist.

1060
39:45.560 --> 39:46.440
Zhang Guang.

1061
39:46.800 --> 39:49.060
You drive pretty fast in this little car.

1062
39:49.320 --> 39:50.360
Look at your hairstyle.

1063
39:50.360 --> 39:51.400
What, are you studying art?

1064
39:51.400 --> 39:52.520
Be polite.

1065
39:53.760 --> 39:54.560
Don't try to scam me.

1066
39:54.560 --> 39:56.620
Who do you think you're messing with?

1067
39:57.120 --> 39:58.280
No, what else do you want to do?

1068
39:58.280 --> 39:59.120
What?

1069
39:59.800 --> 40:01.200
Your family owes people so much money.

1070
40:01.200 --> 40:02.680
Don't you know you should pay it back?

1071
40:02.680 --> 40:03.400
Hurry up and pay it back.

1072
40:03.400 --> 40:04.640
Yes, pay it back.

1073
40:05.240 --> 40:07.240
How can I pay it back when I have no money?

1074
40:07.240 --> 40:08.900
It's easy if you have no money.

1075
40:09.280 --> 40:10.600
If you have no money, I'll bring these brothers

1076
40:10.600 --> 40:12.000
to visit you once a day.

1077
40:12.000 --> 40:13.080
When we get tired of visiting you,

1078
40:13.080 --> 40:15.440
we'll take some valuable small parts off you.

1079
40:15.440 --> 40:17.640
Yes, take off small parts.

1080
40:18.080 --> 40:19.840
I really have no money, brother.

1081
40:19.840 --> 40:21.440
It's useless even if you call me dad.

1082
40:21.440 --> 40:23.520
If you don't pay back the money today...

1083
40:23.520 --> 40:24.000
No, no.

1084
40:25.160 --> 40:26.880
I'll put you on ice,

1085
40:26.880 --> 40:28.600
and take a little off you every day.

1086
40:28.600 --> 40:30.520
I'll make a call, brother. I'll make a call.

1087
40:30.520 --> 40:31.600
Call in front of me.

1088
40:31.880 --> 40:32.880
No tricks. Are you calling?

1089
40:32.880 --> 40:33.520
Right now, I'll take off

1090
40:33.520 --> 40:34.640
your two kneecaps.

1091
40:34.640 --> 40:34.960
No, no, no.

1092
40:34.960 --> 40:38.040
Yes, take off the kneecaps.

1093
40:38.040 --> 40:39.520
Mom, hurry.

1094
40:39.520 --> 40:40.240
Mom, come quickly.

1095
40:40.240 --> 40:40.480
Someone wants to

1096
40:40.480 --> 40:41.940
take off my kneecaps, Mom.

1097
40:42.240 --> 40:43.960
Lawyer Li, this is what you asked me to find,

1098
40:43.960 --> 40:45.560
the information of the client from Shanyuan Bank.

1099
40:45.560 --> 40:47.560
It's sorted out. Please take a look.

1100
40:48.680 --> 40:50.240
Is that debt case finished?

1101
40:51.040 --> 40:52.960
Not yet. They appealed again.

1102
40:53.920 --> 40:54.600
I advised them,

1103
40:54.600 --> 40:56.520
but they are quite persistent.

1104
41:00.280 --> 41:02.080
I'll take a call. It's my client.

1105
41:05.600 --> 41:06.040
Hello.

1106
41:08.280 --> 41:08.800
What?

1107
41:10.000 --> 41:11.530
Zhang Guang was kidnapped?

1108
41:11.920 --> 41:12.840
By whom?

1109
41:14.400 --> 41:15.840
Okay, Auntie. Don't worry.

1110
41:15.840 --> 41:16.400
Call the police first.

1111
41:16.400 --> 41:17.530
I'll be right there.

1112
41:20.920 --> 41:21.520
Lawyer Li,

1113
41:22.160 --> 41:23.160
my... my classmate

1114
41:23.160 --> 41:25.620
seems to have been kidnapped by Xiaolongnü.

1115
41:25.680 --> 41:27.440
Kidnapped by Xiaolongnü?

1116
41:27.840 --> 41:28.720
Officer,

1117
41:28.720 --> 41:30.040
I swear on my great-grandmother,

1118
41:30.040 --> 41:31.760
I didn't even touch a piece of his dandruff.

1119
41:31.760 --> 41:33.120
Give your great-grandmother a break.

1120
41:33.120 --> 41:34.360
You just didn't have the time.

1121
41:34.360 --> 41:35.920
He wanted to take me apart.

1122
41:35.920 --> 41:38.780
You scared my son so much his hands and feet are cold.

1123
41:38.960 --> 41:40.280
You're in the mafia.

1124
41:40.640 --> 41:41.320
What kind of good person

1125
41:41.320 --> 41:43.240
goes out with a bunch of hooligans?

1126
41:43.240 --> 41:45.120
Come back. What are you yelling about?

1127
41:45.120 --> 41:47.120
No, officer, they're not hooligans.

1128
41:47.120 --> 41:48.840
These are extras I hired.

1129
41:48.840 --> 41:50.720
Strictly speaking, they're all performing artists.

1130
41:50.720 --> 41:52.160
Act one out, quick. Come on.

1131
41:52.160 --> 41:53.720
I said, a truly good horse,

1132
41:53.800 --> 41:54.080
Go back.

1133
41:54.080 --> 41:55.210
its head is the king.

1134
42:07.040 --> 42:08.600
What are you doing here?

1135
42:08.880 --> 42:11.610
To see how the opposing lawyer learned to kidnap.

1136
42:16.760 --> 42:18.520
I'm not a hooligan. I'm from a law firm.

1137
42:18.520 --> 42:19.120
Look.

1138
42:19.480 --> 42:21.240
Dong Beihu, what are you doing?

1139
42:21.960 --> 42:23.320
Both lawyers are here, right?

1140
42:23.320 --> 42:24.960
Let's go to the mediation room to talk.

1141
42:24.960 --> 42:25.640
Right.

1142
42:25.640 --> 42:27.200
Give my son an explanation.

1143
42:27.200 --> 42:27.640
Hooligan.

1144
42:27.640 --> 42:29.100
I was introducing myself.

1145
42:47.160 --> 42:48.560
I need to call Dong Beihu.

1146
42:48.960 --> 42:50.200
You're really crazy.

1147
42:50.200 --> 42:51.680
Calling a Siberian tiger?

1148
42:51.920 --> 42:53.080
Isn't that an animal?
